{% doc %}
  The theme's own "Acheter maintenant" button, in the brand colours (Shopify's
  express button keeps the colours of Shop Pay and can't be restyled). It
  adds the chosen variant, then goes straight to Shopify's checkout, where
  Shop Pay, Apple Pay… are offered at the top. Without JavaScript the form
  post itself leads to the checkout (return_to).

  @param {object} product - The product of the surrounding product form

  @example
  {% render 'buy-now-button', product: product %}
{% enddoc %}
{%- assign buy_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
<button
  type="submit"
  name="return_to"
  value="/checkout"
  class="buy-now-button"
  data-buy-now-button
  {% unless buy_variant.available %}
    disabled
  {% endunless %}
>
  {{- 'products.buy_now' | t -}}
</button>
